# Copy to .env for local development (.env is gitignored).
#
# WARNING: EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined as plain strings into the JS bundle
# by Metro at build time. Anyone with the APK can unzip it and read this key.
# Only ship a build carrying this key to people you'd hand the raw key to.
# For a public release, move the OpenAI call behind a server you control.
#
# For EAS builds the value must also exist as an EAS environment variable —
# .env is never uploaded to EAS Build. See README.
EXPO_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
